        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "雨の音を聞きながら、温かいお茶を飲んで沁み沁みと読書を楽しむ休日。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "旧友と再会し、昔の思い出話を沁み沁みと語り合う時間は何物にも代えがたい。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "深夜の静まり返った部屋で、一人沁み沁みとこれまでの人生を振り返る。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 3,
